                          <Text>          = Server Rules =
 
 1. No bigotry, slurs, or
    similar in chat, 
    faction names,
    and grids.
 
 2. No gravity drives or
    piston guns or similar
    lag generators
 
 3. Don't back-seat
    moderate. Bring
    problems with other
    players to admins.
 
 4. Have fun! Please, don't
    take it too seriously.</Text>
